{"lyrics":"[00:02.10]Juice\n[00:02.38]YCJ man\n[00:06.34](The Beat Asylum)\n[00:06.78]Ayy, gang\n[00:24.28].30 in that .40, you don't want no smoke, ayy (Nuh-uh)\n[00:31.36]Laughing at these niggas, they a bunch of jokes, ayy (Haha)\n[00:34.88]If I catch you, then I catch you, you get poked (Boom)\n[00:38.22]Illuminati with that shotty, take yo' soul, ayy\n[00:40.82].30 in that .40, feening for some opps (Gimme that)\n[00:45.26]Every time, you see me scamming on the block\n[00:47.98]Fuck 12, still running from the cops (Fuck 'em)\n[00:52.04]They been tryna catch me up, serving rocks (You won't)\n[00:55.46]Fuck 12, fuck 12, nigga, fuck 12 (Fuck 12)\n[00:59.04]They just took my brodie Jody, nigga, fuck 12 (Free Jody)\n[01:02.24].12 guage on me, that's my homie, It's gon' buck 12 (Boom, boom)\n[01:05.82]You a snitch, yeah you a rat, and I don't trust 12\n[01:08.92]I was screamin' on that block, I was clutchin' on that Glock, servin' them rocks\n[01:14.70]It ain't nothing on the blocks, but a whole lotta shots, and selling them rock\n[01:17.04]And I'm still screamin', \"Free O' from the feds\" (Free O')\n[01:18.88]If I catch a goofy opp, then I'm leaving them dead (Woo)\n[01:22.16]Headshots, headshots, we ain't fucking with legs (Okay)\n[01:25.90]I need top from a thot, keep on closing they legs (Bitch)\n[01:29.20]Run up on me, catch a shot, .223 at yo' head, ayy (Boom)\n[01:32.96]Murder she wrote, with this bullet, he bled, ayy\n[01:36.76]Murder she wrote, leave 'em dead on the pavement (He gone)\n[01:52.54]Young nigga, I was trappin' out the basement\n[01:57.50]Ain't never have enough to under switch blows (Lil' blow)\n[02:01.68]Looked my victim in the eyes and I left that nigga froze (He dead)\n[02:30.24]Left that nigga froze, robbed him, took that nigga clothes\n[02:34.76]Run up on me, woah, .40 on me finna blow (Boom)\n[02:38.54]Fuckin' yo' bitch in the back of my Challenger\n[02:42.28]Daring a nigga to challenge us (Skrrt)\n[02:44.84]Run up on me, then fuck it, we gon' shoot 'em\n[02:56.10]I swear that my niggas be dangerous (Gang)\n[03:03.54]Gang\n[03:03.84]Ayy, free bars for Jody","words":[[2.1,2.22,"Juice"],[2.38,2.62,"YCJ"],[6.12,6.22,"man"],[6.34,6.42,"(The"],[6.46,6.52,"Beat"],[6.58,6.72,"Asylum)"],[6.78,6.86,"Ayy,"],[24.12,24.26,"gang"],[24.28,24.3,".30"],[24.34,24.42,"in"],[27.12,27.22,"that"],[27.24,27.68,".40,"],[27.98,28.04,"you"],[28.16,28.5,"don't"],[28.54,28.62,"want"],[28.66,28.86,"no"],[28.9,29.1,"smoke,"],[29.16,29.24,"ayy"],[29.8,30.66,"(Nuh-uh)"],[31.36,31.78,"Laughing"],[31.86,31.94,"at"],[32.0,32.18,"these"],[32.24,32.58,"niggas,"],[32.68,32.84,"they"],[33.0,33.0,"a"],[33.08,33.3,"bunch"],[33.34,33.36,"of"],[33.46,33.84,"jokes,"],[33.88,33.94,"ayy"],[33.98,34.84,"(Haha)"],[34.88,34.98,"If"],[35.16,35.16,"I"],[35.24,35.46,"catch"],[35.52,35.56,"you,"],[35.68,35.84,"then"],[35.98,35.98,"I"],[36.08,36.34,"catch"],[36.38,36.46,"you,"],[36.54,36.62,"you"],[36.7,36.86,"get"],[36.98,37.36,"poked"],[37.4,38.16,"(Boom)"],[38.22,38.98,"Illuminati"],[39.1,39.28,"with"],[39.38,39.44,"that"],[39.52,39.8,"shotty,"],[39.96,40.14,"take"],[40.18,40.26,"yo'"],[40.38,40.66,"soul,"],[40.74,40.8,"ayy"],[40.82,40.84,".30"],[40.88,41.02,"in"],[41.72,41.9,"that"],[41.92,41.98,".40,"],[42.04,42.34,"feening"],[42.56,42.74,"for"],[42.96,43.06,"some"],[43.28,43.56,"opps"],[43.6,44.18,"(Gimme"],[45.08,45.22,"that)"],[45.26,45.38,"Every"],[45.54,45.82,"time,"],[45.86,45.94,"you"],[45.98,46.12,"see"],[46.16,46.24,"me"],[46.34,46.84,"scamming"],[46.92,47.02,"on"],[47.06,47.1,"the"],[47.28,47.56,"block"],[47.98,48.78,"Fuck"],[48.8,49.02,"12,"],[49.38,49.74,"still"],[49.88,50.16,"running"],[50.26,50.4,"from"],[50.44,50.5,"the"],[50.7,51.1,"cops"],[51.14,51.36,"(Fuck"],[51.4,51.5,"'em)"],[52.04,52.16,"They"],[52.24,52.32,"been"],[52.42,52.7,"tryna"],[52.84,53.06,"catch"],[53.12,53.14,"me"],[53.38,53.72,"up,"],[53.76,54.08,"serving"],[54.16,54.32,"rocks"],[54.36,54.42,"(You"],[54.56,54.88,"won't)"],[55.46,55.76,"Fuck"],[55.78,55.98,"12,"],